WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:11.240
In Germany, a child is born. Let's call her Laura. Straight away, she's in the care of the church.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.220
In Germany, every third hospital is run by
a Christian organization.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.580
Laura is christened in a Catholic church.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.329
She belongs to the world's largest religious
community - Christianity.

00:00:23.329 --> 00:00:26.500
1.1 billion Christians are Roman Catholic.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.980
800 million are Protestant, and 300 million
are Eastern Orthodox.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.520
Christianity is a wealthy religion.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:46.960
In the US, for example, faith-based business contributes
more to the economy

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.380
than the top ten technology businesses.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.720
Churches there are financed
by donations.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:58.300
In Germany, the Catholic and Lutheran churches are worth some 345 billion euros.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:02.800
They own shares, real estate, breweries and
even film production companies.

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:07.660
Over a million people work for the churches.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:12.640
That's second only to the German state, which employs
over 4.5 million.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.140
Laura goes to Catholic daycare.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:23.000
When she's older, she'll be confirmed - and
presented with the world's biggest selling book.

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:29.080
At least 3 billion copies of the Bible have
been sold to date - making it a nice little

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:30.900
earner for publishers.

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:35.620
As an adult, Laura will pay an additional
9 percent of her income tax as church tax.

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:42.040
Although many have opted to leave, the Catholic
and Lutheran churches still saw record high

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:46.760
takings in 2015 of 11.5 billion euros.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:51.700
When Laura dies, she wants a Christian burial.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:55.060
And her final resting place will be in a Catholic
cemetery.

